{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/枪锋践誓","pageid":8916,"revid":21925,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E6%9E%AA%E9%94%8B%E8%B7%B5%E8%AA%93&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E6%9E%AA%E9%94%8B%E8%B7%B5%E8%AA%93&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E6%9E%AA%E9%94%8B%E8%B7%B5%E8%AA%93&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>枪锋践誓</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.9E.AA.E9.94.8B.E8.B7.B5.E8.AA.93\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"枪锋践誓\"><b>枪锋践誓</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 枪锋践誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/33/2o8oqbnz351wxycrs7qm5gq8cpqen1i.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E6%9E%AA%E9%94%8B%E8%B7%B5%E8%AA%93.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/33/2o8oqbnz351wxycrs7qm5gq8cpqen1i.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E6%9E%AA%E9%94%8B%E8%B7%B5%E8%AA%93.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/33/2o8oqbnz351wxycrs7qm5gq8cpqen1i.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />枪锋践誓\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，最大生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>，攻击时技能倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冲阵减伤</font></span>]效果额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦主动释放含有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">位移</span>]的技能、触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"援护防御\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">援护防御</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">10</font>点，每回合最多增加1次。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]产生的冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>（最低降至1）；<br />✦大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">24</font>点时，攻击时技能倍率额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，伤害额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>；<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">50</font>点时，击败目标时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，最大生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>，攻击时技能倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冲阵减伤</font></span>]效果额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦主动释放含有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">位移</span>]的技能、触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"援护防御\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">援护防御</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">10</font>点，每回合最多增加1次。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]产生的冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>（最低降至1）；<br />✦大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">24</font>点时，攻击时技能倍率额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，伤害额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>；<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">50</font>点时，击败目标时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，最大生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">50%</font>，攻击时技能倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冲阵减伤</font></span>]效果额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦主动释放含有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">位移</span>]的技能、触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"援护防御\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">援护防御</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">10</font>点，每回合最多增加1次。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]产生的冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>（最低降至1）；<br />✦大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">24</font>点时，攻击时技能倍率额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>，伤害额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>；<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">50</font>点时，击败目标时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"信仰之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/40px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/60px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/80px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"信仰之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/40px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/60px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/80px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"谋定之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/